03:41.980 --> 03:49.940
of upside or strong rally here is just highlighting just how much pressure Bitcoin is under. And no

03:49.940 --> 03:55.360
excuses really for Bitcoin. Here's the S&P 500 here over a three-week period, shrugging off a 10%

03:55.360 --> 04:03.080
