04:58.140 --> 05:02.980
Bitcoin and that we're in a bear market downtrend. We look at Bitcoin here on the weekly, clearly we

05:02.980 --> 05:08.280
have the high, the peak in October. And let's not forget that Bitcoin peaked four months before the

05:08.280 --> 05:15.900
