05:22.180 --> 05:28.260
trend, you had the big first peak, five, six weeks down, then a sideways move and then another six

05:28.260 --> 05:35.780
weeks down. So the argument here is simply that this is just trending sideways, recharging before

05:35.780 --> 05:42.260
another leg lower. That is what we should be looking out for. Also, when you just flip the narrative a

05:42.260 --> 05:48.420
