08:53.320 --> 08:58.720
lower in the sort of second phase of a bear market. That's traditionally how most markets would unfold.

08:59.340 --> 09:06.240
For this to just go down straight from a high to a five-month low and then start a new bull market

09:06.240 --> 09:12.640
